This project replicates my laptop's Alpine x86_64 setup from the 3.3mb mini-root FS.

Mostly using symlinks to Sway configuration files from a git repo.
This means being able to re-install from scratch in 15 minutes.

Usage:

sudo ./ALPM-FS/run.sh --reset private 
do something if needed, then 'exit'
sudo ./create_img /dev/sdX

Resources:
https://gitlab.alpinelinux.org/alpine/alpine-conf

